《三个正方形》 Three Squares — chalkboard style sample (code-made film)

IMAGES, FOOTAGE, MODELS
- None. The classroom wall, the two board panels, frame, chalk tray, clock, chalk, cells, wipe and wet streak are drawn in
  code (js/stage.js, js/chalk.js, js/app.js, js/film.js). No photographs, scans, stock footage or generated images.

CHALK WRITING
- 勾股定理 is our own stroke data (js/hz.js: a centre line and a stroke type per stroke, GF 0023-2020 stroke order),
  drawn by the chalk engine. Proportions were checked by eye against LXGW WenKai TC set behind the data on the check page
  (index.html?lab=hz); no outline was copied or traced, and the font never appears in the film.
- a, b, c, +, =, 2 are written through the single-line font EMS Delight by the same chalk engine.

